   "lines": [
    "In the evening I",
    "gave a whist club",
    "(at Alices instigation",
    "—she is too sweet to",
    "me in everything);",
    "~~to~~ Doug Robinson,",
    "Harry Haddon, Archie",
    "Russell, Ice Iselin,",
    "Bob Sedgwick, Gasper",
    "Griswold, Willys Betts,",
    "West, Em, and my-",
    "self. We had great",
    "fun; I like all the",
    "fellows (especially",
    "Doug — who may",
    "become a connection)",
    "very much.",
    "I also like young",
    "Bigelow, Trimble, and",
    "the Dodges."
   ],
